---
---

<aside class="aira-docked-panel">
  <div class="aira-panel-topbar">
    <span class="brand-aira" style="font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700; color: #0052A3;"><em>A</em>IRA</span>
    <div class="aira-panel-actions" aria-hidden="true">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
        <line x1="12" y1="17" x2="12" y2="22" />
        <path d="M5 17h14v-2l-3-3V5a2 2 0 0 0-2-2h-4a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v7l-3 3v2z" />
      </svg>
      <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
        <line x1="18" y1="6" x2="6" y2="18" />
        <line x1="6" y1="6" x2="18" y2="18" />
      </svg>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="aira-white-container">
    <h3 class="aira-sidebar-greeting">
      <span class="brand-linear"><span class="brand-aira"><em>A</em>IRA</span></span>
      <span class="title-active-blue">Siap</span><br />
      <span class="title-active-blue">Membantu!</span>
    </h3>

    <div class="aira-helper-question">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
        <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10" />
        <line x1="12" y1="16" x2="12" y2="12" />
        <line x1="12" y1="8" x2="12.01" y2="8" />
      </svg>
      <span>Bagaimana <span class="brand-aira"><em>A</em>IRA</span> dapat membantumu?</span>
    </div>

    <div class="aira-interactive-card" data-guide="nav" role="button" tabindex="0">
      <h4>Temukan halaman yang kamu cari</h4>
      <p>Bilang saja tujuanmu, saya tunjukkan langkahnya.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="aira-interactive-card" data-guide="form" role="button" tabindex="0">
      <h4>Bantu isi formulir</h4>
      <p><span class="brand-aira"><em>A</em>IRA</span> pandu satu per satu, tanpa bingung.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="aira-settings-title">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
        <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3" />
        <path d="M19.4 15a1.65 1.65 0 0 0 .33 1.82l.06.06a2 2 0 0 1 0 2.83 2 2 0 0 1-2.83 0l-.06-.06a1.65 1.65 0 0 0-1.82-.33 1.65 1.65 0 0 0-1 1.51V21a2 2 0 0 1-2 2 2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-.09A1.65 1.65 0 0 0 9 19.4a1.65 1.65 0 0 0-1.82.33l-.06.06a2 2 0 0 1-2.83 0 2 2 0 0 1 0-2.83l.06-.06a1.65 1.65 0 0 0 .33-1.82 1.65 1.65 0 0 0-1.51-1H3a2 2 0 0 1-2-2 2 2 0 0 1 2-2h.09A1.65 1.65 0 0 0 4.6 9a1.65 1.65 0 0 0-.33-1.82l-.06-.06a2 2 0 0 1 0-2.83 2 2 0 0 1 2.83 0l.06.06a1.65 1.65 0 0 0 1.82.33H9a1.65 1.65 0 0 0 1-1.51V3a2 2 0 0 1 2-2 2 2 0 0 1 2 2v.09a1.65 1.65 0 0 0 1 1.51 1.65 1.65 0 0 0 1.82-.33l.06-.06a2 2 0 0 1 2.83 0 2 2 0 0 1 0 2.83l-.06.06a1.65 1.65 0 0 0-.33 1.82V9a1.65 1.65 0 0 0 1.51 1H21a2 2 0 0 1 2 2 2 2 0 0 1-2 2h-.09a1.65 1.65 0 0 0-1.51 1z" />
      </svg>
      <span>Pengaturan Situs</span>
    </div>

    <div class="aira-setting-item">
      <span class="aira-setting-label" id="textScaleLabel">Perbesar Teks</span>
      <div class="aira-stepper-control">
        <button type="button" class="aira-stepper-btn" data-step="text" data-dir="-1" aria-label="Perkecil teks">
          <span aria-hidden="true" style="font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700;">T</span>
        </button>
        <span class="aira-stepper-value" id="textScaleDisplay" role="status" aria-live="polite" aria-labelledby="textScaleLabel">100%</span>
        <button type="button" class="aira-stepper-btn" data-step="text" data-dir="1" aria-label="Perbesar teks">
          <span aria-hidden="true" style="font-size: 19px; font-weight: 700;">T</span>
        </button>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="aira-setting-item">
      <span class="aira-setting-label" id="lineSpacingLabel">Perbesar Jarak Antar Baris</span>
      <div class="aira-stepper-control">
        <button type="button" class="aira-stepper-btn" data-step="line" data-dir="-1" aria-label="Perkecil jarak baris">
          <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
            <polyline points="8 4 12 1 16 4" />
            <polyline points="8 20 12 23 16 20" />
            <line x1="12" y1="1" x2="12" y2="23" />
            <line x1="18" y1="9" x2="22" y2="9" />
            <line x1="18" y1="15" x2="22" y2="15" />
          </svg>
        </button>
        <span class="aira-stepper-value" id="lineSpacingDisplay" role="status" aria-live="polite" aria-labelledby="lineSpacingLabel">100%</span>
        <button type="button" class="aira-stepper-btn" data-step="line" data-dir="1" aria-label="Perbesar jarak baris">
          <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
            <polyline points="7 4 12 0 17 4" />
            <polyline points="7 20 12 24 17 20" />
            <line x1="12" y1="0" x2="12" y2="24" />
            <line x1="18" y1="7" x2="23" y2="7" />
            <line x1="18" y1="17" x2="23" y2="17" />
          </svg>
        </button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</aside>
